  p { margin: 0; }
</style></head>
<body><div class="page"><header style="text-align:center;padding-bottom:0.425em;margin-bottom:0.425em;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(156, 156, 156)"><h1 style="margin:0;font-size:1.9em;font-weight:700;color:#222222;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Avery Chen</h1><div style="color:#555555;font-size:1.02em;margin-top:0.15em">Software Engineer</div><div style="color:#555555;font-size:0.88em;margin-top:0.3em"><a href="mailto:avery.chen@example.com">avery.chen@example.com</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp;(555) 010-2244&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp;Toronto, ON&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://averychen.dev">averychen.dev</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://github.com/averychen">github.com/averychen</a></div></header><section style="margin-top:1em;break-inside:avoid"><h2 style="font-weight:700;color:#222222;margin:0 0 0.4em;font-size:0.92em;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;border-bottom:2px solid #222222;padding-bottom:0.18em">Summary</h2><p style="margin:0">Backend engineer with 4 years building high-throughput services. Owns reliability and developer-experience tooling.</p></section><section style="margin-top:1em;break-inside:avoid"><h2 style="font-weight:700;color:#222222;margin:0 0 0.4em;font-size:0.92em;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;border-bottom:2px solid #222222;padding-bottom:0.18em">Experience</h2><div style="margin-bottom:0.62em"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1em">
          <div style="min-width:0"><strong>Senior Software Engineer</strong><span>, Northwind Systems</span></div>
          <div style="text-align:right;color:#555555;white-space:nowrap;flex:0 0 auto"><div>2022 – Present</div><div style="font-size:0.92em">Toronto, ON</div></div>
        </div><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0.2em 0 0;padding:0"><li style="display:flex;gap:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.2em"><span style="flex:0 0 auto;color:#222222" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span style="min-width:0">Cut p99 API latency 38% by introducing a read-through cache and query batching.</span></li><li style="display:flex;gap:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.2em"><span style="flex:0 0 auto;color:#222222" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span style="min-width:0">Led migration of 40+ services to a shared async job runtime.</span></li></ul></div><div style="margin-bottom:0.62em"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1em">
          <div style="min-width:0"><strong>Software Engineer</strong><span>, Brightloop</span></div>
          <div style="text-align:right;color:#555555;white-space:nowrap;flex:0 0 auto"><div>2020 – 2022</div><div style="font-size:0.92em">Remote</div></div>
        </div><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0.2em 0 0;padding:0"><li style="display:flex;gap:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.2em"><span style="flex:0 0 auto;color:#222222" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span style="min-width:0">Shipped the billing ledger handling $12M/yr with zero reconciliation errors.</span></li></ul></div></section><section style="margin-top:1em;break-inside:avoid"><h2 style="font-weight:700;color:#222222;margin:0 0 0.4em;font-size:0.92em;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;border-bottom:2px solid #222222;padding-bottom:0.18em">Education</h2><div style="margin-bottom:0.62em"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1em">
          <div style="min-width:0"><strong>B.S. Computer Science</strong><span>, University of Waterloo</span></div>
          <div style="text-align:right;color:#555555;white-space:nowrap;flex:0 0 auto"><div>2016 – 2020</div><div style="font-size:0.92em">GPA 3.8/4.0</div></div>
        </div></div></section><section style="margin-top:1em;break-inside:avoid"><h2 style="font-weight:700;color:#222222;margin:0 0 0.4em;font-size:0.92em;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;border-bottom:2px solid #222222;padding-bottom:0.18em">Skills</h2><div style="margin-bottom:0.2em"><strong>Languages:</strong> TypeScript, Go, Python, SQL</div><div style="margin-bottom:0.2em"><strong>Infra:</strong> Postgres, Redis, Kubernetes, AWS</div></section><section style="margin-top:1em;break-inside:avoid"><h2 style="font-weight:700;color:#222222;margin:0 0 0.4em;font-size:0.92em;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;border-bottom:2px solid #222222;padding-bottom:0.18em">Projects</h2><div style="margin-bottom:0.62em"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1em">
          <div style="min-width:0"><strong>openledger</strong></div>
          
        </div><div style="color:#555555;font-style:italic;margin-top:0.12em"><a href="https://github.com/averychen/openledger">Open-source double-entry ledger library.</a></div><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0.2em 0 0;padding:0"><li style="display:flex;gap:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.2em"><span style="flex:0 0 auto;color:#222222" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span style="min-width:0">1.2k stars; used by 3 fintech startups in production.</span></li></ul></div></section></div></body></html>"
`;

