  h1, h2 { font-family: "Roboto Slab", "Source Serif 4", Georgia, serif; }
  p { margin: 0; }
</style></head>
<body><div class="page"><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 32%;gap:1.4em;align-items:start"><div style="min-width:0"><header style="text-align:center;padding-bottom:0.3em;margin-bottom:0.3em;border-bottom:1px solid rgb(160, 168, 176)"><h1 style="margin:0;font-size:1.9em;font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Avery Chen</h1><div style="color:#555555;font-size:1.02em;margin-top:0.15em">Software Engineer</div></header><section style="margin-top:0.7em;break-inside:avoid"><h2 style="font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 0.28em;font-size:0.92em;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em"><span style="border-bottom:1.5px solid #2c3e50;padding-bottom:0.12em">Summary</span></h2><p style="margin:0">Backend engineer with 4 years building high-throughput services. Owns reliability and developer-experience tooling.</p></section><section style="margin-top:0.7em;break-inside:avoid"><h2 style="font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 0.28em;font-size:0.92em;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em"><span style="border-bottom:1.5px solid #2c3e50;padding-bottom:0.12em">Experience</span></h2><div style="margin-bottom:0.42em"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1em">
          <div style="min-width:0"><strong>Senior Software Engineer</strong><span>, Northwind Systems</span></div>
          <div style="text-align:right;color:#555555;white-space:nowrap;flex:0 0 auto"><div>2022 – Present</div><div style="font-size:0.92em">Toronto, ON</div></div>
        </div><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0.12em 0 0;padding:0"><li style="display:flex;gap:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.12em"><span style="flex:0 0 auto;color:#2c3e50" aria-hidden="true">▸</span><span style="min-width:0">Cut p99 API latency 38% by introducing a read-through cache and query batching.</span></li><li style="display:flex;gap:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.12em"><span style="flex:0 0 auto;color:#2c3e50" aria-hidden="true">▸</span><span style="min-width:0">Led migration of 40+ services to a shared async job runtime.</span></li></ul></div><div style="margin-bottom:0.42em"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1em">
          <div style="min-width:0"><strong>Software Engineer</strong><span>, Brightloop</span></div>
          <div style="text-align:right;color:#555555;white-space:nowrap;flex:0 0 auto"><div>2020 – 2022</div><div style="font-size:0.92em">Remote</div></div>
        </div><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0.12em 0 0;padding:0"><li style="display:flex;gap:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.12em"><span style="flex:0 0 auto;color:#2c3e50" aria-hidden="true">▸</span><span style="min-width:0">Shipped the billing ledger handling $12M/yr with zero reconciliation errors.</span></li></ul></div></section><section style="margin-top:0.7em;break-inside:avoid"><h2 style="font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 0.28em;font-size:0.92em;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em"><span style="border-bottom:1.5px solid #2c3e50;padding-bottom:0.12em">Projects</span></h2><div style="margin-bottom:0.42em"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1em">
          <div style="min-width:0"><strong>openledger</strong></div>
          
        </div><div style="color:#555555;font-style:italic;margin-top:0.12em"><a href="https://github.com/averychen/openledger">Open-source double-entry ledger library.</a></div><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0.12em 0 0;padding:0"><li style="display:flex;gap:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.12em"><span style="flex:0 0 auto;color:#2c3e50" aria-hidden="true">▸</span><span style="min-width:0">1.2k stars; used by 3 fintech startups in production.</span></li></ul></div></section></div><aside style="background:rgb(238, 240, 241);padding:0.5em 0.85em;border-radius:0"><section style="margin-top:0.7em;break-inside:avoid"><h2 style="font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 0.28em;font-size:0.92em;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em"><span style="border-bottom:1.5px solid #2c3e50;padding-bottom:0.12em">Contact</span></h2><div style="margin-bottom:0.12em;word-break:break-word"><a href="mailto:avery.chen@example.com">avery.chen@example.com</a></div><div style="margin-bottom:0.12em;word-break:break-word">(555) 010-2244</div><div style="margin-bottom:0.12em;word-break:break-word">Toronto, ON</div><div style="margin-bottom:0.12em;word-break:break-word"><a href="https://averychen.dev">averychen.dev</a></div><div style="margin-bottom:0.12em;word-break:break-word"><a href="https://github.com/averychen">github.com/averychen</a></div></section><section style="margin-top:0.7em;break-inside:avoid"><h2 style="font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 0.28em;font-size:0.92em;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em"><span style="border-bottom:1.5px solid #2c3e50;padding-bottom:0.12em">Skills</span></h2><div style="margin-bottom:0.12em"><strong>Languages:</strong> TypeScript, Go, Python, SQL</div><div style="margin-bottom:0.12em"><strong>Infra:</strong> Postgres, Redis, Kubernetes, AWS</div></section><section style="margin-top:0.7em;break-inside:avoid"><h2 style="font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 0.28em;font-size:0.92em;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em"><span style="border-bottom:1.5px solid #2c3e50;padding-bottom:0.12em">Education</span></h2><div style="margin-bottom:0.42em"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1em">
